{"nodes": [{"id": "backend_app_pipeline_runner_prepare", "label": "prepare", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "backend/app/pipeline/runner.md", "source_location": "Flow to files", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "LangGraph node that cleans ticket text and finds candidate spans. stage1_normalize/normalize.py supplies normalize, mask_cards, and fold_arabic. candidates.py supplies recall-tuned find_candidates. dates.py resolve_date is used later during extract."}, {"id": "backend_app_pipeline_runner_jev_classify", "label": "jev_classify", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "backend/app/pipeline/runner.md", "source_location": "Flow to files", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Jev reads the ticket for category, priority, flags, and candidate picks, including a reversed-option check. Implemented in stage2_classify/jev.py through langchain-typesafe."}, {"id": "backend_app_pipeline_runner_gemini_classify", "label": "gemini_classify", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "backend/app/pipeline/runner.md", "source_location": "Flow to files", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Gemini structured output sampled three times. In cascade mode this same node runs combine() from stage2_classify/cascade.py to decide among Jev, Gemini, and a human."}, {"id": "backend_app_pipeline_runner_extract", "label": "extract", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "backend/app/pipeline/runner.md", "source_location": "Flow to files", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Turns picks into a reference, amount, date, and phone. stage3_extract/extract.py finalize and fill_gaps verify spans so a value that is not in the ticket is dropped."}, {"id": "backend_app_pipeline_runner_lookup", "label": "lookup", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "backend/app/pipeline/runner.md", "source_location": "Flow to files", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Looks up the transaction in ZainCash records. stage4_lookup/lookup.py match_transaction uses app/db/repository.py and the lookup_transaction tool."}, {"id": "backend_app_pipeline_runner_decide", "label": "decide", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "backend/app/pipeline/runner.md", "source_location": "Flow to files", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Routes the ticket to a team and checks red flags. stage5_decide/rules.py decide and merge_reasons apply priority and escalation."}, {"id": "backend_app_pipeline_runner_draft", "label": "draft", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "backend/app/pipeline/runner.md", "source_location": "Flow to files", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Plan 3 stage. stage6_draft/agent.py and drafting.py use LangChain create_agent. guardrails.py checks the draft with a Jev requests_credentials noul plus regex. Knowledge search is a draft tool, not a separate graph node."}, {"id": "backend_app_pipeline_runner_graph_orchestration", "label": "Pipeline Graph Orchestration", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "backend/app/pipeline/runner.md", "source_location": "Orchestration and wiring", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "graph.py builds the graph, runs a batch, and summarizes. state.py is LangGraph state. contracts.py holds shared dataclasses. factory.py wires real Jev and Gemini clients. io/serialize.py maps an outcome to a dict or database row."}, {"id": "backend_app_pipeline_runner_lookup_transaction", "label": "lookup_transaction", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "backend/app/pipeline/runner.md", "source_location": "The 8 drafting tools", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "r